LanguageData.OA_LetterDiplomaticSummit_Flounder:
Although in some negotiation matters, your negotiators have led the situation to your advantage, in most cases, you are still silenced by rebuttals and have to compromise. In the end, at the end of this negotiation, your negotiator secured the following situation for you: 

Your very few requests have been accepted by the court of {SETLEment_label}, but the vast majority of your requests have still been rejected by the court of {SETLEment_label}. Furthermore, although your negotiator tried to make your demands seem reasonable, the court of {SETLEment_label} still left a bad impression on you. 

Goodwill with {1}: {2} 
Received: 
Assist points × {3}

LanguageData.OA_LetterDiplomaticSummit_Triumph:
In this one-sided negotiation, your negotiator seems to have insight into people's hearts and is always able to accurately step on the other party's bottom line without crossing it. And when your opponent questions your negotiator, your negotiator can resolve it with just a few words. In the end, even if your opponent racked their brains, they could not reasonably reject your request, which resulted in the following situation for you:

The court of {SETLEment_label} almost obediently agreed to the vast majority of your demands and believed that it was their fault for not paying attention to your difficulties. This means that even if your negotiator puts forward quite excessive conditions, they only believe that it is your negotiator venting their dissatisfaction without too much investigation.
In addition, to express their apologies, when you left the court, the court attendants presented you with a gift to symbolize your friendly relationship.

Goodwill with {1}: {2} 
Received: 
Assist points × {3} 
Sliver × {4}
